landscaping requirements, Public Services Committee discussion procedures, effect of the alley
vacation on configuration of the block and neighborhood, and past ownerships and use of the
property.  It was advised the hospital plans to build a 16' wall on a portion of the parking lot that will
contain a generator to provide emergency power when needed, and that the area will be landscaped
and the wall will be composed of brick similar to that on the exterior of the hospital building.  Upon
inquiry, Mr. Steil reviewed landscaping considerations and information available concerning the site
layout.  Motion carried.  Voting “yes” – all members of the governing body present with the
exception of Mr. Laybourn voting “no”.
